*.iopin VDD
*.iopin VSS
x7 VDD net1 VIN VSS inv_PI_d2
x8 VDD net2 net1 VSS inv_PI_d4
x9 VDD net3 net2 VSS inv_PI_d8
x10 VDD VOUT net3 VSS inv_PI_d16
.ends


* expanding   symbol:  /foss/designs/PhaseInterpolator/Custom_std_cells/inv_PI_d2.sym # of pins=4
